---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About — Museum of Passion Projects" description="Colophon of the Museum of Passion Projects.">
  <section class="colophon">
    <h1>About the Museum</h1>

    <p>
      The Museum of Passion Projects was founded in 2025 by
      <a href="https://x.com/srijan_mahajan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">srijan</a>
      and
      <a href="https://x.com/heyprat" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pratyush</a>.
    </p>

    <p>
      The collection is held in a single file and catalogued by hand. The Museum keeps no
      visitor records and sends no newsletter.
    </p>

    <p>
      Wall text and labels are set in EB Garamond. Accession numbers and signage are set in
      IBM Plex Mono.
    </p>

    <p>Built with Claude Code.</p>

    <p class="admin">Collection enquiries: via the artists.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
